# Aquarium bubbles need dieSeed variety

Use AquariumBubbles (buildAquariumBubbles) seeded by dieSeed + bubble index for size, oval aspect, opacity, rise speed, x-wobble, delay, highlight, and rim. Avoid (i % N) size ladders and (i * 37) % width lanes. Density ladder: 14/18/24/32 for faces 1/2-3/4/5-6.

## Verification
- Verified: npm run lint && npm run build clean after AquariumBubbles seeded builder; SharkTankOverlay and FishOverlay use dieSeed+index
- Failure pattern avoided: Ambient aquarium bubbles look identical/copy-pasted across dice and bubble indices
- Dead-end ruled out: Raising bubble count alone while keeping i%N size and i*37 left lanes still reads as a repeating pattern
